{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41451","headline":"归燕词 · 李建勳","name":"归燕词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽翼势虽微，云霄亦可期。\n飞翻自有路，鸿鹄莫相嗤。\n待侣临书幌，寻泥傍藻池。\n冲人穿柳径，捕蝶遶花枝。\n广厦来应徧，深宫去不疑。\n雕梁声上下，烟浦影参差。\n旧地人潜换，新巢雀谩窥。\n双双暮归处，疎雨满江湄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}